<title>UK: New Zealand sets 70 million stg bond due Aug 1998.</title>
<headline>New Zealand sets 70 million stg bond due Aug 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    70 MLN STG    COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    26.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S 26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 1	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
